WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Vidiyoyi ikusonyeza zitsanzo za matenda a retina a shuga opanga mitsempha yatsopano.

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:18.290
Pa chitsanzo choyamba pali mawu akuti pali mitsempha yatsopano pa disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:16.580
Zitsanzo zotsatira zikusonyeza kumbuyo kwa diso ndi malo osawoneka bwino.
